# Packs of a user's (alpha.vocab, beta.vocab beside this file), each used:
# alpha's action with its terms, beta's role and field.
use alpha
use beta
contract Club
parties we, steward

thing Card
  holder we
  badge text

can lodge

test "the steward lodges the card"
  we create with badge = "B-7"
  steward lodge -> lodged
